msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#. CyberFoodONI.STRINGS.UI.SETTINGS.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "CyberFoodONI.STRINGS.UI.SETTINGS.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Choose which original dining bonuses Bionic Duplicants receive in addition to Synthetic Dining Experience.\n\nOriginal food effects: {0}\nIncludes food quality morale, spices, garnish and food-specific effects.\n\nDining room effects: {1}\nIncludes Mess Hall and Great Hall meal effects.\n\nEnabled food and dining bonuses last 3 cycles for Bionic Duplicants.\n\nChanges apply to future meals and are saved globally."
msgstr "选择仿生人在‘仿生感官用餐’之外还能获得哪些原版进餐加成。\n\n原版食物效果：{0}\n包括食物品质士气、香料、装饰配菜和菜品自带效果。\n\n餐厅效果：{1}\n包括食堂和高档餐厅的进餐效果。\n\n开启后，食物与餐厅加成对仿生人持续 3 周期。\n\n更改会从下一次进餐开始生效，并作为全局设置保存。"

