#. CyberFoodONI.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.CYBERFOODONI_SENSORYDINING.NAME
msgctxt "CyberFoodONI.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.CYBERFOODONI_SENSORYDINING.NAME"
msgid "Synthetic Dining Experience"
msgstr "仿生感官用餐"

#. CyberFoodONI.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.CYBERFOODONI_SENSORYDINING.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "CyberFoodONI.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.CYBERFOODONI_SENSORYDINING.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Taste, aroma and texture simulators provide the pleasure of dining without supplying usable energy. Bionic Duplicants insist that this is not wasting food, but high-precision sensory calibration."
msgstr "味觉、嗅觉与口感模拟器提供用餐的愉悦体验，但不会供应可利用的能量。仿生人坚持认为，它不是在浪费食物，而是在进行高精度感官校准。"
